  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Maternal and Child Health through Integrated Social Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase the access and use of maternal and child health services, strengthen cholera control, and improve targeting of social services in the Recipient&#xE2;&#x80;&#x99;s territory, with a particular focus on areas affected by Hurricane Matthew.</narrative>
  </description>
